     "ref": "06-government-legal/un-udhr/udhr-010.txt",
     "text": "Uaihira foti lia ruma hasoru ema ida, molok sei dauk halo justisa, ema ne’e sei hatán nu’u sala laek; afoin sei fo mos fatin atu nia hetan tulun hodi tahan-án iha justisa laran."
